# The desk agent's run log is append-only, one JSON record per line, and two
# checkouts append to it: the scheduled jobs on the owner's machine and the
# weekly review in the cloud. With the default driver every such pair conflicts
# at the end of the file, and an unattended launcher has to abort the merge and
# leave the record unpushed. `union` keeps both sides' lines, which for a log
# whose lines are independent records is the correct merge, not a shortcut.
# Order may interleave; nothing reads it positionally.
tools/desk_agent/runs.jsonl merge=union
